- **Statements:** **Theorem 3.1:** ZMC is \(C_{=}P\)-complete for multiplicatively disjoint circuits and formulas. **Theorem 3.2:** unrestricted ZMC belongs to \(\mathrm{coRP}^{PP}\). **Theorem 3.3:** ZMC is coNP-complete for monotone formulas and monotone circuits.
